{"segment_id": "segment_00011", "start": 330.0, "end": 360.0, "speech": "还没有超过二十九岁呢啊！他这个地方其实开了一个小的玩笑，就呃，刻板印象当中啊，我们会认为女性对自己的年年龄一般都不希望报超过三十岁，对吧？有这样一个西方的类似于我们不轻易问别人年龄这样一个隐私的小的点。OK，好，那文章讲完了之后，接下来我们做一些口语听力训练啊。那我问您答，伊迪，您可以看文章里找答案啊。", "frames": [{"path": "frames/frame_000019.webp", "time": 343.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["LIZ: She does, doesn't she!", "I read she's twenty-nine, but she must be at least forty.", "KATE: I'm sure she is.", "LIZ: She was a famous actress when I was still at school.", "KATE: That was a long time ago, wasn't it?", "LIZ: Not that long ago!", "I'm not more than twenty-nine myself."], "scores": [0.98938, 0.99367, 0.98992, 0.98058, 0.97671, 0.96861, 0.98982], "boxes": [[[61.0, 548.0], [684.0, 548.0], [684.0, 607.0], [61.0, 607.0]], [[53.0, 602.0], [1292.0, 608.0], [1292.0, 676.0], [53.0, 671.0]], [[61.0, 671.0], [558.0, 675.0], [558.0, 731.0], [61.0, 726.0]], [[59.0, 732.0], [1319.0, 732.0], [1319.0, 793.0], [59.0, 793.0]], [[58.0, 789.0], [1024.0, 792.0], [1024.0, 861.0], [58.0, 858.0]], [[58.0, 847.0], [587.0, 856.0], [586.0, 922.0], [57.0, 914.0]], [[55.0, 914.0], [925.0, 914.0], [925.0, 980.0], [55.0, 980.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000020.webp", "time": 351.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Comprehension"], "scores": [0.9995], "boxes": [[[94.0, 138.0], [463.0, 138.0], [463.0, 198.0], [94.0, 198.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000021.webp", "time": 358.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Comprehension", "1 T: Kate is with Liz, isn't she?"], "scores": [0.99948, 0.98603], "boxes": [[[94.0, 138.0], [462.0, 138.0], [462.0, 198.0], [94.0, 198.0]], [[145.0, 281.0], [838.0, 283.0], [838.0, 343.0], [145.0, 340.0]]]}}], "review_flags": [], "asr_model": "Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B"}
